  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> The projectile slams into your mouth, breaking bone and shattering teeth.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass a Challenging (+0) Endurance Test or gain @Condition[Unconscious], otherwise gaining @Condition[Stunned] (3). You also suffer a Broken Bone (Major) and lose 1d10 teeth – Amputation (Average). \n If the projectile was a Lead Bullet you must also pass a Challenging (+0) Toughness Test or also lose your tongue (see under Amputated Parts) as the almond-shaped projectile penetrates deeply, tearing through the soft tissues of your mouth. Also roll for any Pummel Quality.</p>"
